1
00:00:00,150 --> 00:00:05,780
PolyGlance. Crypto at a glance,
on Even Realities G2.

2
00:00:06,780 --> 00:00:13,470
The ticker view shows live Bitcoin
and Ethereum prices from CoinGecko,
refreshing every sixty seconds.

3
00:00:14,480 --> 00:00:22,610
Tap once for live prediction market
odds from Polymarket. Real Bitcoin
markets, with the live chance of
each outcome.

4
00:00:23,620 --> 00:00:28,860
Tap again for paper trading. You start
with ten thousand virtual dollars.

5
00:00:28,960 --> 00:00:37,980
Swipe up to buy one hundred dollars
of Bitcoin. Cash, holdings and profit
update instantly. No real money,
just practice.

6
00:00:38,980 --> 00:00:46,580
The new alerts view watches Bitcoin
for you. Set a target price, and the
glasses tell you the moment it hits.

7
00:00:46,680 --> 00:00:52,100
It also shows your Telegram bot,
so alerts reach you even when
the glasses are off.

8
00:00:53,120 --> 00:00:57,020
And now, voice. Just speak
to the glasses.

9
00:00:57,120 --> 00:01:06,400
Say buy one hundred Bitcoin, and
PolyGlance does it. Voice commands
run through Groq Whisper,
right on the glasses.

10
00:01:07,420 --> 00:01:10,320
The Telegram bot keeps watching
in the cloud.

11
00:01:10,420 --> 00:01:18,540
Set an alert from any chat, and it
pings you the moment Bitcoin crosses
your price. It runs on a Cloudflare
Worker, day and night.

12
00:01:19,550 --> 00:01:26,550
PolyGlance. Prices, odds, paper trading,
alerts and voice. Hands free, at a glance.
